{sov: Notes}
Acoustic Electronic Fusion: Combines country-folk acoustic strumming with driving
EDM pop production in B minor / D major.

Core Progression: The entire song is built around the 4-bar cycle of Bm - G - D
with an A major passing chord landing on the final beat of beat 4 leading back
to Bm.

Acoustic Strumming: Use continuous, driving 16th-note folk-style strumming on an
acoustic guitar during the verse and chorus sections.

Electronic Drop: During the instrumental drop, the synth lead takes over the
melody while the rhythm section locks into a four-on-the-floor kick beat.
{eov}